[0.001, "o", "\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  ⚠️  REMEDIATION APPROVAL REQUIRED\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n\r\n  The agent wants to execute the following:\r\n\r\n  Action 1:\r\n    SQL:    CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY idx_audit_log_action_table ON audit_log (action, table_name)\r\n    Reason: The JSONB aggregation query on audit_log filters by action and table_name but has no index on these columns, causing a full sequential scan of a 98MB table (70MB data + 29MB indexes). This query accounts for 19.79% of total database time. A composite index on (action, table_name) will allow an Index Scan instead of a full table scan.\r\n\r\n══════════════════════════════════"]
