[0.001, "o", "\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  ⚠️  REMEDIATION APPROVAL REQUIRED\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n\r\n  The agent wants to execute the following:\r\n\r\n  Action 1:\r\n    SQL:    ANALYZE orders\r\n    Reason: The orders table has never been ANALYZEd (last_analyze and last_autoanalyze are both NULL), and seq_scan has accumulated 1,000,000 rows from sequential scans. Stale statistics cause the planner to make poor decisions. Running ANALYZE will refresh column statistics so the planner can correctly estimate selectivity for the new composite index idx_orders_status_order_date and choose optimal plans going forward. Note: the EXTRACT() anti-pattern in the application query must also be fixed at the code level — rewr"]
[0.000, "o", "iting to use a date range (order_date >= '2024-01-01' AND order_date < '2024-02-01') is required to allow index usage, as EXTRACT() wrapping a column is non-sargable and forces a full sequential scan regardless of indexes.\r\n\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"]
